{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.KZ.FuchsianConvergence","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.KZ.FuchsianConvergence","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.KZ.FuchsianFormal","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.Normed.Ring.Lemmas","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.Normed.Module.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.SpecificLimits.Normed"],"declarations":8,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.FuchsianConvergence.kz_summable","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.FuchsianConvergence.kz_summable","kind":"theorem","line":171,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/FuchsianConvergence.lean#L171-L179","doc":"**KZ**: the normalised formal solution at `z = 0` of the three-point KZ system converges on\n`|z| < 1`, for any residues `A, B` (non-resonance is only needed for existence). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.FuchsianConvergence.summable_norm_mul_pow","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.FuchsianConvergence.summable_norm_mul_pow","kind":"theorem","line":155,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/FuchsianConvergence.lean#L155-L169","doc":"**Convergence**: under the hypotheses of `bounded_weighted`, `∑ ‖H_k‖ s^k` converges for\nevery `0 ≤ s < r`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.FuchsianConvergence.bounded_weighted","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.FuchsianConvergence.bounded_weighted","kind":"theorem","line":95,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/FuchsianConvergence.lean#L95-L153","doc":"**Boundedness of the weighted coefficients** `‖H_k‖ r^k` when `‖M_m‖ ≤ C ρ^m` and\n`r ρ < 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.FuchsianConvergence.sum_pow_sub_le","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.FuchsianConvergence.sum_pow_sub_le","kind":"theorem","line":81,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/FuchsianConvergence.lean#L81-L93","doc":"`∑_{j<k} θ^{k-j} ≤ θ/(1−θ)` for `0 ≤ θ < 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.FuchsianConvergence.norm_coeff_le","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.FuchsianConvergence.norm_coeff_le","kind":"theorem","line":70,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/FuchsianConvergence.lean#L70-L79","doc":"**The coefficient estimate.** For a normalised formal solution and `k ≥ max(1, 4‖A‖)`,\n`k ‖H_k‖ ≤ 2 ∑_{j<k} ‖M_{k-j}‖ ‖H_j‖`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.FuchsianConvergence.norm_le_of_indicial","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.FuchsianConvergence.norm_le_of_indicial","kind":"theorem","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/FuchsianConvergence.lean#L57-L68","doc":"**Uniform injectivity of the indicial operator for large `k`.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.FuchsianConvergence.norm_ad_le","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.FuchsianConvergence.norm_ad_le","kind":"theorem","line":51,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/FuchsianConvergence.lean#L51-L55","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.FuchsianConvergence.natCast_mul_eq_smul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.FuchsianConvergence.natCast_mul_eq_smul","kind":"theorem","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/FuchsianConvergence.lean#L47-L48","signatureChunk":0}]}